repository-code: "https://github.com/DiogoRibeiro7/heteroTests"
license: "Apache-2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-01"
abstract: |
  heteroTests provides a collection of heteroscedasticity diagnostics for
  linear models in R. It includes classic tests such as White's and the
  Breusch-Pagan test along with plotting helpers and advanced residual
  analysis.
keywords:
  - statistics
  - heteroscedasticity
  - diagnostics
  - R
